SUMMARY:A Midsummer Night's Gala
DTSTART:20260822T173000
DTEND:20260822T220000
DTSTAMP:20260822T114037Z
UID:81388ad65c90fd9c417cceab5d6b56@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Artistree for a celebration advancing our mission to make
  the arts accessible to all. Enjoy cocktails\, a three-course plated dinne
 r\, dancing\, and specially curated silent and live auctions in a beautifu
 l summer setting. Your attendance directly supports the classes\, performa
 nces\, and outreach programs that bring creativity\, connection\, and oppo
 rtunity to our community. We’re thrilled to have Vicki Ferentinos as our
  gala emcee\, bringing her signature wit and warmth along with credits fro
 m Comedy Central\, Bravo\, and Food Network\, and a four-star run at the E
 dinburgh Fringe Festival. Special musical guests The Tricksters will deliv
 er a mix of favorite dance hits to keep the energy up and the party going.
  Local favorite Norm Frates returns as auctioneer with his trademark humor
  and enthusiasm\, making the evening’s auction as entertaining as it is 
 exciting. Help us make a difference—join us for a night to remember! A l
 imited number of individual tickets and tables are available for purchase.
  Preferred RSVP by July 22.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:The Quechee Club\, 3268 Quechee Main St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/a-midsumme
 r-nights-gala-13-07-2026-10-09-26
END:VEVENT
